{"kind":"tea","teaId":"bleeding-woman","mood":"dark","heat":2,"text":"She spent everything she had and still got worse… then one touch changed everything… … Twelve years. Every doctor she could afford. Mark says she “suffered many things of many physicians, and had spent all that she had, and was nothing bettered, but rather grew worse.” She’s broke and out of options. She hears about Jesus and decides she’s not even going to ask. She just needs to touch his clothes. She comes up behind him in the crowd, touches, and immediately she’s healed. She could have disappeared. That was the whole plan. But he stops the entire procession and asks “who touched my clothes?” The disciples think he’s crazy, look at this crowd. He keeps looking. She comes forward terrified and tells him everything. All twelve years. Out loud. He calls her Daughter and tells her to go in peace. He wouldn’t let her leave as a secret. I’m crying. ---","voice":"FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5","words":[{"w":"She","start":0,"end":0.163},{"w":"spent","start":0.209,"end":0.406},{"w":"everything","start":0.464,"end":0.836},{"w":"she","start":0.894,"end":0.987},{"w":"had","start":1.068,"end":1.3},{"w":"and","start":1.347,"end":1.498},{"w":"still","start":1.579,"end":1.811},{"w":"got","start":1.869,"end":2.02},{"w":"worse…","start":2.055,"end":2.543},{"w":"then","start":2.821,"end":2.972},{"w":"one","start":3.03,"end":3.158},{"w":"touch","start":3.193,"end":3.39},{"w":"changed","start":3.448,"end":3.75},{"w":"everything…","start":3.785,"end":4.342},{"w":"…","start":4.493,"end":4.876},{"w":"Twelve","start":5.155,"end":5.445},{"w":"years.","start":5.48,"end":5.991},{"w":"Every","start":6.269,"end":6.56},{"w":"doctor","start":6.618,"end":6.92},{"w":"she","start":6.978,"end":7.059},{"w":"could","start":7.094,"end":7.21},{"w":"afford.","start":7.233,"end":7.697},{"w":"Mark","start":7.976,"end":8.185},{"w":"says","start":8.243,"end":8.417},{"w":"she","start":8.464,"end":8.591},{"w":"“suffered","start":8.638,"end":8.975},{"